# The whole project is built and run in Linux containers: shell scripts, Go
# sources and Compose files must keep LF line endings on every checkout,
# whatever core.autocrlf says (DESIGN.md §3.6, T22). The container's shell
# cannot run a script with CRLF line endings, and the gate's gofmt check
# fails on a Go source that has them.
* text=auto eol=lf
